[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6719418842","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247#issuecomment-6719418842","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247","id":6719418842,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABkIIx2g","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:44:49Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T08:44:49Z","body":"Independent re-review of the #1247 successor found a remaining structural join defect (`IR1247-NATIVE-ORIGIN-JOIN-001`). The focused suite passes 66 tests, but an additional actual-native counterexample is accepted.\n\nAt one real private Git commit, two complete published ledgers contain the same proposal ID and case binding. One proposal edits `data/ingredients/mapped/Existing.yaml`; the other edits `data/ingredients/mapped/Untouched.yaml`, with its authentic distinct preimage and valid original payload. The native plan correctly prepares the first proposal. The crosswalk declares the second proposal, verifies that it really is published, then reports all three origins applied because the join compares only ID, head and case hashes.\n\nThis is a private accounting provenance defect. No source application occurred; the before/after owner inventory is identical. Native preparation itself correctly binds its selected original.\n\nPlease compare the crosswalk origin with the actual native prepared original `proposal_binding` and `payload_binding`: complete proposal object, published head/path/hash, original owner/preimage and original payload. Different local capture locations containing the same exact published bytes can remain valid. The coordinated final payload must remain a separate concept, because legitimate reconciled composition can differ from an individual original payload. Add the same-head/different-valid-original negative alongside the matched-original and composed-final positives.\n\nEvidence: `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/final-accounting1247-independent-v1/finding-001-native-origin-join.json`; probe `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/final-accounting1247-independent-v1/probe_origin_join.py` (7b1218766055be96a1ad6fb2efee4aff146543478eda36075784b65e003bc63a); result `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/final-accounting1247-independent-v1/origin-join-counterexample.json` (54e18a5a78584508548d026231dd557ea608408aa478df1b4de3fd8fc53f52cf). Reviewed helper SHA256: `a5964a9d774bd70dc07318626d2285e322bad34ce80f8e85143b7435d0d7ba5e`. Original evidence and source remain unchanged.\n\nA second bounded provenance check is needed in the private helper (`IR1247-LOCAL-HEAD-BOUNDARY-002`). An actually stale integration HEAD at entry is refused by native `prepare`, but an empty private commit inserted during final proof checking changes HEAD from `d7547772292b580e560bccf441494efbe59d1229` to `9b4e016713e96135dae1e418181193963d2e3ed9` and the helper still returns structural success. The complete source/proof/owner bytes remain unchanged; this is a local revision-time binding issue, not payload corruption or a native write bypass.\n\nCapture actual local integration HEAD at entry and require the same HEAD at final return, in addition to the existing native input/membership checks. When a native plan is supplied, its baseline must match that entry HEAD. Add the late empty-commit negative and preserve matched-head and initially stale-head controls. This check belongs only in the private helper and makes no claim about remote branch freshness.\n\nExact proof: `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/final-accounting1247-independent-v1/final-boundary-results.json` (2c8b4ef9afc0a058ebc9605254176eea96a022bf3ee0ead49ce17f5ecfe7a561); probe `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/final-accounting1247-independent-v1/probe_final_boundaries.py` (d8c12402022ec24ed2f839ce821d40e33a90e236cde7b8655510e2a559d8eb6e). The immutable first review remains at `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/final-accounting1247-independent-v1/HANDOFF.json` (9d250f90c67bb52ea3e3986d9318badf3c095e6d40fdc7931dd61b45e954ee68).\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6719418842/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6719641336","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247#issuecomment-6719641336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247","id":6719641336,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABkIWW-A","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:09:15Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T09:09:15Z","body":"Independent review of the immutable private v3 crosswalk verifies both filed defects fixed: the complete actual original-proposal binding rejects crossed native origins, and the local-HEAD checks reject stale/late baseline changes. The review reran all 76 frozen tests plus 22 adversarial probes; no new helper correctness defect was reproduced.\n\nThree nonblocking coverage qualifications are retained as TECH1247-COV-001 through -003:\n\n- The frozen suite has no explicit hardlink case. Four independent actual hardlink fixtures now verify the early and late refusals; this supplements rather than rewrites the frozen suite.\n- The 19-mode evidence/native negative group asserts refusal without per-case owner-preservation assertions. Independent readback of all 42 retained native fixtures confirms original owners/mappings unchanged and application outputs absent, separately accounting for the intentionally injected Late.yaml.\n- Seven inherited resolution negatives reach the mandatory-context gate before their named deeper faults. Their PASS results are real refusals but are not seven independent deeper-path proofs. New real-context tests and adversarial probes provide the stated actual coverage.\n\nThese are accurately bounded test coverage notes for a future immutable maintained suite; they do not reproduce a helper defect or justify broadening acceptance. Keep the current reviewed v3 immutable. Actual campaign intake, current-origin reconciliation, native planning, scientific review and release authorization remain separate requirements.\n\nAuthor handoff `f666f61bbe5ded31d10c69375b4dc009d77986f00aa7d6c995d8e38368ed930a`; author manifest `345f28b3bb36a2c2870130d68e5b16cf2740e51aca7d2e7d6e216f0d7f809f89`; reviewed crosswalk `6b247656ec34a5280a7b10ba1dea6a67edfc12fa0aab004cbb2ec9575a650753`. Independent W08 handoff `44827c980a1f192845a4162d150346f204111c560f852a4cc192dfd1b46f3211`, manifest `a46e7efe93b6d57d28b6077bd743effc74b70d933088456f9fc5f7c0fb9fe6ff`, under `.temp/crosswalk1247-v3-independent-v1` in W08's worktree. No maintained data or gate was changed.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6719641336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]